      "title": "Hi-limit thermostat continuity",
      "body": "Hi-limit thermostat: < 1 \u03a9. Press red reset button if tripped from overtemperature.",
      "sourceExcerpt": "Hi-limit thermostat: < 1 \u03a9. Press red reset button if tripped from overtemperature.",
      "requiresInput": true,
      "branches": [
